<!--
  IP-XACT (IEEE 1685-2014) component description for axi4_to_dfi_bridge.
  Tapeout-readiness program T7 (../../DESIGN_READINESS.md) packaging deliverable.
  Ports generated verbatim from the RTL header (src/axi4_to_dfi_bridge.v) so that
  `make pkg` (pkg/check_ipxact.sh) port-sync passes by construction; bus interfaces,
  memory map and parameters hand-authored from the interface + syn/constraints.
  AXI4 references the standard AMBA abstraction/bus defs by VLNV (resolved from the
  integrator's AMBA library); DFI references a DDR-PHY DFI bus def (JEDEC DFI).
-->
